name: Installed offline dependency audit through finite approval, triage and report
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/missing-command.txt
require-live-snap: 20 run cargo-audit:scan | missing-command-draft
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART missing
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 regular Cargo.lock | missing-prerequisite
expect-not: u Accept result
ask: Does the absent lockfile remain failed work with a clear prerequisite and no clean-scan claim?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART install
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 35 Build project context: | deterministic-context
submit: use threat-model
submit: options threat-model:import
submit: set path .kuzushi/manual-context.json
submit: set activate false
submit: set label Owned dependency metadata
submit: run threat-model:import
require-live-snap: 35 threat-model:import saved | imported-context
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT READY Map ready | map-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks cargo-audit
paste-file: @ART/binary-setting.txt
keys: Enter
paste-file: @ART/database-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set cargoAuditOffline true
submit: set cargoAuditAllowStale true
submit: set cargoAuditTimeoutMs 60000
submit: set cargoAuditMaxLockfileBytes 1048576
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | study-form
keys: L
require-live-snap: 35 Draft ready | fixed-plan
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | total-calls
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | review-calls
type: 1
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L Home
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | allowance-start
expect: 60000 ms per job
expect: 1048576 bytes per lockfile
expect: offline
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | allowance-review
expect: Execution model: none
expect: Protected review calls: 1
expect: 0 model-provider requests
expect: scanner-service costs are not
expect: estimated.
expect-not: One job can make several requests
ask: Does approval disclose three fixed jobs, one worker, captured-lockfile limits, offline advisory data and protected Review capacity?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 APPROVED STUDY | approved-study
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 dispatcher pid | started
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 completed 3 / planned 3 | completed-study
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 30 Viewing Scan | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 RUSTSEC-2020-0071 | dependency-finding
expect: signal-only
submit: decision deferred Declared dependency needs owner review; runtime reachability unassessed
require-live-snap: 25 deferred | operator-decision
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Enter export | report
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 REPORT | report-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 REPORT | report-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 REPORT | report-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 REPORT | report-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 REPORT | report-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: report-detail-40x12
ask: Are recurrence, the owner decision, scope and database limitations readable without implying source reachability or a fix?
resize: 120x36
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 completed 3 / planned 3 | restored-study
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | restored-finding
expect: RUSTSEC-2020-0071
expect: review decisions are recorded
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/cargo_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve three observations, the human decision, copied database and source without another job or provider request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
